<html ><head ><meta charset="UTF-8"  /><meta name="author" content="Martin Walther - @tinuwalther"  /><meta name="keywords" content="Pode, PSHTML, PowerShell, Mermaid Diagram"  /><meta name="description" content="Builds beatuifull HTML-Files with PSHTML from native PowerShell-Scripts"  /><link href="\assets\BootStrap\bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet"  /><link href="\assets\style\style.css" rel="stylesheet"  /><script src="\assets\BootStrap\bootstrap.bundle.min.js"  ></script><script src="\assets\Chartjs\Chart.bundle.min.js"  ></script><title >#PSXi Index</title><link href="/assets/img/favicon.ico" rel="icon" type="image/x-icon"  /></head><Body ><header ><div Class="jumbotron text-center" Id="j1" Style="padding:15; background-color:#012456"  ><p ><h1 >#PSXi Index</h1></p><p >I ♥ PS Pode > This is an example for using pode and PSHTML, requested by API. The page is 
$(if(Test-Path 'D:\github.com\PodePSHTML\views\Index.pode'){
    $($regex = '[0-9]{4}\-[0-9]{2}\-[0-9]{2}\s[0-9]{2}\:[0-9]{2}\:[0-9]{2}')
    $($index = Get-Content 'D:\github.com\PodePSHTML\views\Index.pode')
    $($created = Get-Date ([regex]::Match($index, $regex).Value))
    $($diffTime = New-TimeSpan -Start $created -End (Get-Date))
    $(if($diffTime.TotalMinutes -gt 60 -and $diffTime.TotalMinutes -lt 1440){
        # $badge = 'badge badge-warning' # Bootstrap v4.6.x
        $badge = 'badge text-bg-warning' # Bootstrap v5.3.x
    }elseif($diffTime.TotalMinutes -gt 1440){
        # $badge = 'badge badge-danger' # Bootstrap v4.6.x
        $badge = 'badge text-bg-danger' # Bootstrap v5.3.x
    }else{
        # $badge = 'badge badge-success' # Bootstrap v4.6.x 
        $badge = 'badge text-bg-success' # Bootstrap v5.3.x
    })
    $(span -class $badge {'{0} Days {1} Hours {2} Minutes' -f $diffTime.Days, $diffTime.Hours, $diffTime.Minutes})
})
 old.</p></div></header><Section Id="section"  ><nav Class="navbar navbar-expand-sm bg-dark navbar-dark sticky-top"  ><div Class="container-fluid"  ><a Target="_self" Class="navbar-brand" href="/"  >»HOME</a><button Class="navbar-toggler" data-bs-target="#collapsibleNavbar" data-bs-toggle="collapse" type="button"  ><span Class="navbar-toggler-icon"  ></span></button><div Class="collapse navbar-collapse" Id="collapsibleNavbar"  ><ul Class="navbar-nav"  ><li Class="nav-item"  ><a Class="nav-link" Target="_blank" href="https://github.com/tinuwalther/"  >GitLab</a></li><li Class="nav-item"  ><a Class="nav-link" Target="_blank" href="https://pshtml.readthedocs.io/en/latest/"  >PSHTML</a></li><li Class="nav-item"  ><a Class="nav-link" Target="_blank" href="https://github.com/jdhitsolutions/MySQLite"  >mySQLite</a></li><li Class="nav-item"  ><a Class="nav-link" Target="_blank" href="https://pester.dev/"  >Pester</a></li><li Class="nav-item"  ><a Class="nav-link" Target="_blank" href="https://www.w3schools.com/html/"  >HTML</a></li><li Class="nav-item"  ><a Class="nav-link" Target="_blank" href="https://getbootstrap.com/"  >Bootstrap</a></li><li Class="nav-item"  ><a Class="nav-link" Target="_blank" href="https://www.cdnpkg.com/jquery/file/jquery.min.js/"  >JQuery</a></li><li Class="nav-item"  ><a Class="nav-link" Target="_blank" href="https://www.cdnpkg.com/Chart.js/file/Chart.bundle.min.js/"  >Chart</a></li><li Class="nav-item"  ><a Target="_self" Class="nav-link" href="/help"  >Help</a></li></ul></div></div></nav><div Class="container-fluid"  ><article Id="Boxes"  ><p > </p><div Class="row row-cols-md-5 mb-5 text-center"  ><div Class="col"  ><div Class="card bg-secondary mb-4 rounded-3 shadow-sm"  ><div Class="card-header py-3 text-bg-danger border-danger" Style="color:#fff"  ><h4 Class="my-0 fw-normal"  >Pode Server</h4></div><div Class="card-body"  ><h1 Class="card-title" Style="color:#fff"  >Pode</h1><p >Shows how to use pode.</p><a Target="_self" Class="w-100 btn btn-lg btn-danger" Style="color:#fff" href="/pode"  >Open</a></div></div></div><div Class="col"  ><div Class="card bg-secondary mb-4 rounded-3 shadow-sm"  ><div Class="card-header py-3 text-bg-primary border-primary" Style="color:#fff"  ><h4 Class="my-0 fw-normal"  >Update Assets</h4></div><div Class="card-body"  ><h1 Class="card-title" Style="color:#fff"  >Assets</h1><p >Shows how to update the assets.</p><a Target="_self" Class="w-100 btn btn-lg btn-primary" Style="color:#fff" href="/update"  >Open</a></div></div></div><div Class="col"  ><div Class="card bg-secondary mb-4 rounded-3 shadow-sm"  ><div Class="card-header py-3 text-bg-success border-success" Style="color:#fff"  ><h4 Class="my-0 fw-normal"  >Database</h4></div><div Class="card-body"  ><h1 Class="card-title" Style="color:#fff"  >SQLite</h1><p >Get data of a SQLite-DB.</p><a Target="_self" Class="w-100 btn btn-lg btn-success" Style="color:#fff" href="/sqlite"  >Open</a></div></div></div><div Class="col"  ><div Class="card bg-secondary mb-4 rounded-3 shadow-sm"  ><div Class="card-header py-3 text-bg-info border-info" Style="color:#fff"  ><h4 Class="my-0 fw-normal"  >Pester</h4></div><div Class="card-body"  ><h1 Class="card-title" Style="color:#fff"  >Pester</h1><p >Visualize Pester Tests.</p><a Target="_self" Class="w-100 btn btn-lg btn-info" Style="color:#fff" href="/pester"  >Open</a></div></div></div><div Class="col"  ><div Class="card bg-secondary mb-4 rounded-3 shadow-sm"  ><div Class="card-header py-3 text-bg-warning border-warning" Style="color:#fff"  ><h4 Class="my-0 fw-normal"  >Mermaid</h4></div><div Class="card-body"  ><h1 Class="card-title" Style="color:#fff"  >Mermaid</h1><p >Create a Mermaid Diagram</p><a Target="_self" Class="w-100 btn btn-lg btn-warning" Style="color:#fff" href="/mermaid"  >Open</a></div></div></div></div><pre Style="color:#000"  >New-Item ./PodePSHTML/upload -Force -Name index.txt | pode.txt | asset.txt # re-builds the equivalent pode page. On load, the page calculate the age of it self and display a green or red badge.</pre></article></div></Section></Body><div Class="container-fluid" Style="background-color:#343a40"  ><footer ><div Class="container-fluid"  ><div Class="row align-items-center"  ><div Class="col-md"  ><p ><a Target="_self" Class="btn-sm btn btn-outline-success" href="#"  >I ♥ PS ></a></p></div><div Class="col-md"  ><p ><a Target="_blank" href="https://www.powershellgallery.com/packages/Pode"  >pode</a> and <a Target="_blank" href="https://www.powershellgallery.com/packages/PSHTML"  >PSHTML</a></p></div><div Class="col-md" Style="color:#000"  ><p >Created at 2024-08-18 12:41:56</p></div></div></div></footer></div></html>
